          %p
            (
            %a{:href => "#BonahonSiebenmann10"}> Bonahon &amp; Siebenmann 2010 p 36 (18 of 67)
            )
          %h2#related_concepts Related concepts
          %ul
            %li
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/lens+space"} lens space
          %p
            Beware that there is also the
            %em un-related
            concept of
          %ul
            %li
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Seifert+surfaces"} Seifert surfaces
          %h2#references References
          %h3#seifert_3manifolds Seifert 3-manifolds
          %p The original article:
          %ul
            %li
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Herbert+Seifert"}> Herbert Seifert
              \:
              = succeed "," do
                %em Topology of 3-dimensional fibered spaces
              = succeed "," do
                %em A textbook of topology
              = succeed "," do
                %strong 89
              = succeed "&rbrack;" do
                %a{:href => "https://www.math.csi.cuny.edu/abhijit/k3m/Seifert-FiberedSpaces-english.pdf"} pdf
          %p Review:
          %ul
            %li
              %p
                Mark Jankins, Walter Neumann:
                = succeed "," do
                  %em Lectures on Seifert Manifolds
                = succeed "," do
                  %a{:href => "https://www.math.columbia.edu/department/neumann/preprints/neumann_lectures%20on%20seifert%20manifolds.pdf"} pdf
                = succeed "&rbrack;" do
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/files/JankinsNeumann-SeifertManifolds.pdf", :title => "pdf"} pdf
            %li
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Peter+Scott"}> Peter Scott
                , section 3 in:
                = succeed "," do
                  %em The Geometries of 3-Manifolds
                %strong 15
                5 (1983) 401-487 &amp;lbrack;
                %a{:href => "https://doi.org/10.1112/blms/15.5.401"}> doi:10.1112/blms/15.5.401
                ,
                = succeed "&rbrack;" do
                  %a{:href => "https://hdl.handle.net/2027.42/135276"} hdl:2027.42/135276
          %p Monographs:
          %ul
            %li
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Kyung+Bai+Lee"}> Kyung Bai Lee
              ,
              = succeed ":" do
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Frank+Raymond"} Frank Raymond
              = succeed "," do
                %em Seifert Fiberings
              %strong 166
              \&amp;lbrack;
              %a{:href => "https://doi.org/10.1090/surv/166"}> doi:10.1090/surv/166
              , toc:
              %a{:href => "https://www.ams.org/books/surv/166/surv166-endmatter.pdf"}> pdf
              \&amp;rbrack;
          %p Further survery:
          %ul
            %li
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Kyung+Bai+Lee"}> Kyung Bai Lee
              ,
              = succeed ":" do
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Frank+Raymond"} Frank Raymond
              %em Seifert Manifolds
              \&amp;lbrack;
              %a{:href => "https://arxiv.org/abs/math/0108188"}> arXiv:math/0108188
              \&amp;rbrack;
          %p
            Discussion via
            = succeed ":" do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/diffeological+spaces"} diffeological spaces
          %ul
            %li
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Patrick+Iglesias-Zemmour"}> Patrick Iglesias-Zemmour
              , Jean-Paul Mohsen:
              %em Seifert Orbifolds
              (2015) &amp;lbrack;
              %a{:href => "http://math.huji.ac.il/~piz/documents/DBlog-Rmk-SeifO.pdf"}> pdf
              ,
              = succeed "&rbrack;" do
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/files/IglesiasZemmour-Mohsen-SeifertOrbifolds.pdf", :title => "pdf"} pdf
          %p See also:
          %ul
            %li
              %p
                Wikipedia,
                %em
                  %a{:href => "http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Seifert_fiber_space"} Seifert fiber space
            %li
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Encyclopedia+of+Mathematics"}> Encyclopedia of Mathematics
                \:
                %em
                  %a{:href => "https://encyclopediaofmath.org/index.php?title=Seifert_fibration"} Seifert fibration
          %h3#seifert_3orbifolds Seifert 3-orbifolds
          %p
            Generalization to the case that already the total space is an
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/orbifold"} orbifold
            (not just its
            = succeed "-quotient):" do
              %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                %semantics
                  %mrow
                    %msup
                      %mi S
                      %mn 1
                  %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} S^1
          %ul
            %li#BonahonSiebenmann10
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Francis+Bonahon"}> Francis Bonahon
              ,
              = succeed ":" do
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Laurent+C.+Siebenmann"} Laurent C. Siebenmann
              = succeed "," do
                %em The classification of Seifert fibred 3-orbifolds
              = succeed "," do
                %em Low Dimensional Topology
              = succeed "&rbrack;" do
                %a{:href => "https://doi.org/10.1017/CBO9780511662744.002"} doi:10.1017/CBO9780511662744.002
          %p See also:
          %ul
            %li#MecchiaSeppi20
              Mattia Mecchia, Andrea Seppi:
              = succeed "," do
                %em On the diffeomorphism type of Seifert fibered spherical 3-orbifolds
              %strong 52
              (2020) 1-39 &amp;lbrack;
              %a{:href => "https://arxiv.org/abs/2005.12023"}> arXiv:2005.12023
              ,
              = succeed "&rbrack;" do
                %a{:href => "https://doi.org/10.13137/2464-8728/30920"} doi:10.13137/2464-8728/30920
          %h3#in_field_theory In field theory
          %p
            On the
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/3d-3d+correspondence"} 3d-3d correspondence
            for Seifert manifolds:
          %ul
            %li
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Sergei+Gukov"}> Sergei Gukov
                ,
                = succeed "," do
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Du+Pei"} Du Pei
                = succeed "," do
                  %em Equivariant Verlinde formula from fivebranes and vortices
                %strong 355
                (2017) 1–50 &amp;lbrack;
                %a{:href => "https://arxiv.org/abs/1501.01310"}> arXiv:1501.01310
                ,
                = succeed "&rbrack;" do
                  %a{:href => "https://doi.org/10.1007/s00220-017-2931-9"} doi:10.1007/s00220-017-2931-9
            %li
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Du+Pei"}> Du Pei
                \:
                = succeed "," do
                  %em 3d-3d correspondence for Seifert manifolds
                = succeed "," do
                  %a{:href => "https://inspirehep.net/literature/1469350"} spire:1469350
                = succeed "&rbrack;" do
                  %a{:href => "https://inspirehep.net/files/d509ff9e32448da3a5674f286b93224a"} pdf
          %p
            Claim of
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/geometric+engineering+of+QFT"} geometric engineering
            of
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/topological+order"} topological order
            on
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/M5-branes"} M5-branes
            in the guise of
            = succeed ":" do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/fusion+categories"} fusion categories
          %ul
            %li
              %p
                Gil Young Cho,
                = succeed "," do
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Dongmin+Gang"} Dongmin Gang
                = succeed "," do
                  %em M-theoretic Genesis of Topological Phases
                %strong 2020
                115 (2020) [
                %a{:href => "https://arxiv.org/abs/2007.01532"}> arXiv:2007.01532
                ,
                = succeed "]" do
                  %a{:href => " https://doi.org/10.1007/JHEP11(2020)115"} doi:10.1007/JHEP11(2020)115
              %blockquote
                %p
                  (by
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/wrapped+brane"} wrapping
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/M5-branes"} M5-branes
                  on, among others, Seifert manifolds)
            %li
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Shawn+X.+Cui"}> Shawn X. Cui
                ,
                = succeed "," do
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Yang+Qiu"} Yang Qiu
                = succeed "," do
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Zhenghan+Wang"} Zhenghan Wang
                = succeed "," do
                  %em From Three Dimensional Manifolds to Modular Tensor Categories
                %strong 397
                (2023) 1191–1235 [
                %a{:href => "https://doi.org/10.1007/s00220-022-04517-4"}> doi:10.1007/s00220-022-04517-4
                ,
                = succeed "]" do
                  %a{:href => "https://arxiv.org/abs/2101.01674"} arXiv:2101.01674
            %li
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Federico+Bonetti"}> Federico Bonetti
                ,
                = succeed "," do
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Sakura+Sch%C3%A4fer-Nameki"} Sakura Schäfer-Nameki
                %em
                  %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}>
                    %semantics
                      %mrow
                        %mi MTC
                        %mo{:stretchy => "false"} [
                        %msub
                          %mi M
                          %mn 3
                        %mo ,
                        %mi G
                        %mo{:stretchy => "false"} ]
                      %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} MTC[M_3,G]
                  \: 3d Topological Order Labeled by Seifert Manifolds
                \&amp;lbrack;
                %a{:href => "https://arxiv.org/abs/2403.03973"}> arXiv:2403.03973
                \&amp;rbrack;
          %p See also:
          %ul
            %li
              Nathan Paul Moore:
              = succeed "," do
                %em String Theory, Chern-Simons Theory and the Fractional Quantum Hall Effect
              = succeed "&rbrack;" do
